  "text": "Granted by Martial Mayhem Mutagen (Moderate)\n\nBenefit You gain a +2 item bonus to skill checks to Disarm, Grapple, Reposition, Shove, and Trip, and your melee Strikes deal 1d4 additional precision damage to off-guard creatures. When you succeed at a melee attack roll, the target is off-guard to your next attack roll against it before the start of your next turn.\n\nDrawback You take a –2 penalty to Will saves, Intelligence-based skill checks, and skill checks to Sense Motive. When you fail at a melee attack roll, you are clumsy 1 until the end of your next turn.",
